snap.level.v1
# Job 3: connect two modules before the solar storm. Squares lean and
# pop in the gusts unless braced; magnets let go unless bolted.
name Storm Bridge
number 3
crew nova
job connect A B
area -2 -3 7 4
give module 0.5 0.5 0 A
give module 4.5 0.5 0 B
give solar 4.5 2 0
give solar 4.5 -1 0
tray square 4 wedge 4 strut 3 bolt 4
par 10
run 6
storm 40 4 10 0.5
